# The SQL scripts are pinned by SHA-256 in Invoke-ScratchGate.ps1, and the
# runner's own SHA-256 is recorded in README.md. Their exact bytes (LF line
# endings) must never be converted on commit or checkout (for example by
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows), or every pin breaks and the runner refuses.
*.sql -text
*.ps1 -text
